### 오늘의 우리 API (IntelliJ HTTP Client)
# 토큰: 브라우저에서 {{host}}/oauth2/authorization/kakao 로 로그인 → accessToken 복사
@host = http://localhost:8080
@token = 여기에_accessToken
@postId = 여기에_게시글ID

### 내 프로필
GET {{host}}/api/v1/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 프로필 입력 (첫 호출 = 가입 완료)
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nickname": "민지", "profileImageUrl": null }

### 온보딩 단계
GET {{host}}/api/v1/users/me/onboarding-status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 초대코드 생성
POST {{host}}/api/v1/couples/invite
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 초대코드로 합류 (상대 계정 토큰으로)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/couples/join
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "inviteCode": "ABC234" }

### 내 커플
GET {{host}}/api/v1/couples/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ===== 게시글 =====
### 작성
POST {{host}}/api/v1/posts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "content": "오늘 처음 같이 본 영화", "postedDate": "2026-10-05" }

### 목록 (정렬: sort=postedDate,desc | postedDate,asc | createdAt,desc | createdAt,asc)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/posts?sort=postedDate,desc&author=me&page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 상세
GET {{host}}/api/v1/posts/{{postId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 수정 (작성자만)
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/posts/{{postId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "content": "고친 내용", "postedDate": "2026-10-04" }

### 삭제 (작성자만)
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/posts/{{postId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ===== 이미지 =====
### 1) 업로드 URL 발급
POST {{host}}/api/v1/images/presigned-url
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "contentType": "image/jpeg", "contentLength": 2048000 }

### 2) 응답의 uploadUrl 로 PUT (Content-Type/Content-Length 동일하게), 3) imageKey 를 게시글에
POST {{host}}/api/v1/posts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "content": "사진 일기", "postedDate": "2026-10-05", "imageKeys": ["couples/.../posts/....jpg"] }
